  15 Aug 2026 - BATCH 33. BRAND PER-LOCATION AUDIT + the tail of the parked sweep.
  Full write-up in region-rebuild-batch33-findings.md.

  194 URLs that sit on a SHARED BRAND DOMAIN with a per-location path were fetched at
  their exact address - graciebarra.com/<slug>/, ufcgym.com/locations/<city>/,
  tsk.com/locations/..., arashido.com/location/..., eastonbjj.com/..., checkmat.com/...
  The brand domain is always healthy, so DNS tells you nothing. 33 of 194 were broken.
  The remaining 509 rows of the parked-and-dead sweep were finished at the same time:
  17 more bad. The sweep is now COMPLETE - all 2,286 previously unscreened links.

  THE GOOD NEWS FIRST. 17 dead Gracie Barra / UFC / 10th Planet / Checkmat location
  pages turned out to be schools that simply LEFT the brand site for their own domain.
  Those are REPOINTED below, not blanked - the directory gains 17 working links.
  Every replacement was opened and the city confirmed against the record.

  UFC GYM is the opposite story: 11 of its location pages either 404 or silently
  redirect to the generic find-a-gym index, and none had a replacement. Note the
  redirect-to-index pattern - it returns HTTP 200 with a real-looking page, so a status
  check alone would pass it. The page must be read and the city matched.

